=== Prompt ===
Who is Cloud Strife?

=== Response ===
Cloud Strife is a fictional character and one of the main protagonists in the Final Fantasy series, first appearing in the video game Final Fantasy VII. He is a mercenary who joins an eco-terrorist group called AVALANCHE to fight against the corrupt Shinra Corporation, which is draining the planet's life energy for its own benefit.

Cloud is a brooding and complex character, with a mysterious past that is gradually revealed throughout the series. He is known for his long silver hair, large Buster Sword, and his ability to perform powerful Materia-based abilities in combat. Cloud is also a key figure in the Compilation of Final Fantasy VII, a series of spin-off games and movies that expand upon the story of Final Fantasy VII.

Cloud has become a popular and iconic character in the gaming industry, and is often cited as one of the greatest video game characters of all time. He has appeared in numerous merchandise, including action figures, posters, and clothing, and has been featured in various forms of media, including anime, manga, and novels.

